{"id": "34492", "title": "冷面恶魔", "author": "陈毓华", "category": "文学名著", "count": 45, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/34/34492.htm", "intro": "他，凌悍墨，恶魔岛冷面悍将，拥有“自燃”异能“火”力四射，可任务执行得太彻底的结果，换来一段长假、一张机票，摇身一变成为兽医院医生，不料门口三天两头一窝被弃小猫小狗，而元凶一下穿套装趴在地上偷窥医院，一下被他那老公公年纪的狗拖到浴室，拯救踩到肥皂滑一跤的他，他只能说──这世界真是太小了！小时肥滋滋跟屁虫一只的她长大了！可她好样的，完全认不得他来，还在他好心收留发酒疯的她，让她当起挂号小姐，看遍药包、名片、医生执照上他的大名后，只吐出七个字：你的名字很特别……", "base": "files/article/html/34/34492", "chapters": [{"title": "序言", "file": "2188439.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第1页", "file": "2188440.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2页", "file": "2188441.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3页", "file": "2188442.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4页", "file": "2188443.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5页", "file": "2188444.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6页", "file": "2188445.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7页", "file": "2188446.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8页", "file": "2188447.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9页", "file": "2188448.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10页", "file": "2188449.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11页", "file": "2188450.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12页", "file": "2188451.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13页", "file": "2188452.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14页", "file": "2188453.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15页", "file": "2188454.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16页", "file": "2188455.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17页", "file": "2188456.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18页", "file": "2188457.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19页", "file": "2188458.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20页", "file": "2188459.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21页", "file": "2188460.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第22页", "file": "2188461.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第23页", "file": "2188462.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第24页", "file": "21